su name verdict from text review to name text pass be ceremony def
  su name review stage ob text of from of this to name text review be text do
  ob text "false" to name text pass be text do
  ob name text review from text "/\\bPASS\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text pass be text do
  ob name text pass be equally from text false then
  su name verdict request begin stage ob text "VERIFIER_ANALYSIS:\n" to name text verdict request be text do
  ob name text review to name text verdict request be plus do
  ob name text verdict request for name news verdict mind to name text verdict raw by num 0 atmost num 8 be write do
  ob name text verdict raw atmost num 1 to name text verdict line be line tail do
  ob name text verdict line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text pass be text do
  ob name text verdict line from text "/^\\s*FAIL\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "false" to name text pass be text do
  su name pass ret
prah

