su name frame checked to name text output be ceremony def
  ob name text request for name frame mind to name text frame raw by num 0 atmost num 12 be write do
  ob text "" to name text output be text do
  ob name text frame raw from text "/^\\s*decision update\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "decision update" to name text output be text do
